JoyTag Server
Copyright 2026 bungabear

This project provides an independent HTTP wrapper for the JoyTag ONNX model.
Image preprocessing follows the JoyTag project:
https://github.com/fpgaminer/joytag

The Docker image includes the official fancyfeast/joytag model, configuration,
and tag vocabulary, distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://huggingface.co/fancyfeast/joytag
Model revision: 6b7f16331a6ccf0fdce37d5a9564715f6e772b22
The model artifacts are unchanged; the server code implements the HTTP API.

